  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_20",
      "hash64": "0446FEFE877B9DC5",
      "text": "The decision to allow you to take on the League\\nwas irregular. An exception among exceptions...[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_21",
      "hash64": "0446FDFE877B9C12",
      "text": "I was against it, as you know. But the academy\\nallowed it, and their ruling is absolute.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_22",
      "hash64": "0446FCFE877B9A5F",
      "text": "Therefore, I will carry out my duty as a member\\nof the Elite Four as flawlessly as I always do.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_01",
      "hash64": "044D89FE8780F5A4",
      "text": "The Elite Trial I devised starts right here.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 44,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_02",
      "hash64": "044D8CFE8780FABD",
      "text": "I call my challenge...the [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]Flying Time Trial[VAR 0xFF00(0000)].[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 52,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_03",
      "hash64": "044D8BFE8780F90A",
      "text": "You will need to fly around the skies of the\\nTerarium while riding a Pokémon.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_04",
      "hash64": "044D86FE8780F08B",
      "text": "Reach the goal within the prescribed time, and\\nyou will pass the trial.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_05",
      "hash64": "044D85FE8780EED8",
      "text": "Fly through the Magnemite rings, and extra time\\nwill be added to the countdown.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_06",
      "hash64": "044D88FE8780F3F1",
      "text": "I recommend you go through as many rings as\\npossible as you fly toward the goal.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_07",
      "hash64": "044D87FE8780F23E",
      "text": "Can you verify that you are ready and willing to\\ntake on my Flying Time Trial?[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_select_01",
      "hash64": "08F660377601C01F",
      "text": "I’m ready!",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_select_02",
      "hash64": "08F661377601C1D2",
      "text": "Explain again?",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_select_03",
      "hash64": "08F662377601C385",
      "text": "Maybe later",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_08",
      "hash64": "044D82FE8780E9BF",
      "text": "Understood.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_23",
      "hash64": "0446FBFE877B98AC",
      "text": "I assume you have a Pokémon to ride on. Please\\nbring it out of its ball.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_legend_01",
      "hash64": "CCD579CEDD8CCEC4",
      "text": "Agias!",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_24",
      "hash64": "0446FAFE877B96F9",
      "text": "...Ah, good. With some effort, this Pokémon\\nshould be capable of flight.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_25",
      "hash64": "0446F9FE877B9546",
      "text": "Your name is Agias, yes? This is for you to eat.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 48,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_legend_02",
      "hash64": "CCD57CCEDD8CD3DD",
      "text": "*chomp chomp* *snarf* *chomp*",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_legend_03",
      "hash64": "CCD57BCEDD8CD22A",
      "text": "Agiaaas!",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_system_01",
      "hash64": "4DB9FEED184A976C",
      "text": "Koraidon is brimming with power!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_system_02",
      "hash64": "4DBA01ED184A9C85",
      "text": "Miraidon is brimming with power!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_26",
      "hash64": "0446F8FE877B9393",
      "text": "What your Agias just consumed is a supplement\\nthat enhances a Pokémon’s flight capabilities.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_27",
      "hash64": "0446F7FE877B91E0",
      "text": "I prepared it using the leaves of a mysterious\\nplant that was found growing in the Terarium.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_28",
      "hash64": "044706FE877BAB5D",
      "text": "Your Agias will be able to soar through the skies\\nas it pleases—but only for the duration of the trial.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 103,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_29",
      "hash64": "044705FE877BA9AA",
      "text": "You have all you need to begin the challenge.\\nI wish you luck.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 62,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_09",
      "hash64": "044D81FE8780E80C",
      "text": "That was an impressive display of punctuality.\\nI must admit, it was satisfying to watch you fly.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_10",
      "hash64": "044A84FE877EB74E",
      "text": "Congratulations. You have cleared my Elite Trial.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 49,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_19",
      "hash64": "044A7DFE877EAB69",
      "text": "Now, a change of location is required once again.\\nCome.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 55,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_11",
      "hash64": "044A85FE877EB901",
      "text": "It seems this attempt was a failure.\\c\\nThose who cannot even keep to a time limit can\\nhardly expect to keep anything together.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 127,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_12",
      "hash64": "044A82FE877EB3E8",
      "text": "If you wish to reattempt my trial, please come\\nand speak with me again.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_13",
      "hash64": "044A83FE877EB59B",
      "text": "You failed yet again...[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_14",
      "hash64": "044A88FE877EBE1A",
      "text": "I now find myself strangely at a loss over the\\ncorrect course of action.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_15",
      "hash64": "044A89FE877EBFCD",
      "text": "You have failed my trial many times over, yes, but\\nyou always pick yourself up to try once more.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_16",
      "hash64": "044A86FE877EBAB4",
      "text": "That in itself could be considered more noble\\nthan reaching a goal within a set time.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_30",
      "hash64": "044378FE8778843C",
      "text": "...I will count your numerous attempts at my trial\\nas proof of your worthiness. You pass.\\c\\nThis seems a fitting result for someone whose\\nvery presence in the club is already exceptional.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 188,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_17",
      "hash64": "044A87FE877EBC67",
      "text": "However, be warned that you will find no such\\nleniency when you face me in battle.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_stop_01",
      "hash64": "A7A1EB09FF048717",
      "text": "Do you want to give up on the Flying Time Trial?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_select_04",
      "hash64": "08F65B377601B7A0",
      "text": "Give up",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_select_05",
      "hash64": "08F65C377601B953",
      "text": "Continue",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
